{
  "dom_id": "step-616951",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Calculating a Total Price from a Unit Price",
  "problem": "Micah is going to the store to buy some sunflower seeds. How much would it cost to buy $\\dfrac{1}{4}$ of a pound of sunflower seeds?\n\n| Item | Price |\n| --- | --- |\n| Pumpkin Seeds | $\\[math] 8 / \\text{lb}$ |\n| Sunflower Seeds | $\\[/math] 5 / \\text{lb}$ |",
  "worked_solution": "The price of sunflower seeds is $\\[math] 5 / \\text{lb}.$ To find the cost of  $\\dfrac{1}{4}$ of a pound of sunflower seeds, we multiply:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5\\times \\frac{1}{4} & =\\frac{5}{1}\\times \\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\times 1}{1\\times 4} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4} \\\\  & =5÷4 \\\\  & =1.25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, it would cost $\\[/math] 1.25$ to buy $\\dfrac{1}{4}$ of a pound of sunflower seeds.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-616951\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"616951\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"4539\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-616951\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Calculating a Total Price from a Unit Price</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"616951\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                    